//
// npu2-only coverage for the causal depthwise 1-D convolution (k=3), the
// convolution at the centre of LFM2's Lfm2ShortConv operator. Mirrors
// eltwise_mul's npu2 lit: the flagship bf16 shape at the registry's measured
// size (2048 x 2048 = seq x conv_dim), plus a narrower one so a channel-count
// assumption cannot hide.
//
// herd 8x1 with tile_s=8 is the measured-best config. herd_x=2 and herd_y>1
// are rejected by asserts inside the builder -- both are SILENT failure modes,
// which is why the profile run below pins the shipped shape rather than
// sweeping.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano
//
// RUN: mkdir -p test_peano_npu2
// RUN: cd test_peano_npu2
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile clean
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile run PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR SEQ=2048 CHANNELS=2048 | FileCheck %s
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile run PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR SEQ=512 CHANNELS=1024 | FileCheck %s
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile profile PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR SEQ=2048 CHANNELS=2048 | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: PASS!
